  "description": "APPLICATION FOR VARIATION OF CONDITION 2 (APPROVED PLANS), ATTACHED TO LBM PLANNING APPLICATION 25/P1654 RELATING TO THE&nbsp; REDEVELOPMENT OF THE SITE TO PROVIDE 294 RESIDENTIAL UNITS, WITH ASSOCIATED CAR PARKING, LANDSCAPING AMENITY AREAS, SECURE CYCLE PARKING AND OTHER ASSOCIATED DEVELOPMENT. CHANGES RELATE TO FACILITATING THE PROVISION OF FOUR\r\nADDITIONAL RESIDENTIAL UNITS. THESE ADDITIONAL UNITS ARE ACHIEVED THROUGH THE\r\nRATIONALISATION OF INTERNAL CYCLE STORAGE AREAS FOLLOWING THE ADOPTION OF THE\r\nGLA’S “SUPPORT FOR HOUSEBUILDING” GUIDANCE, WHICH, AMONGST OTHER MATTERS, INTRODUCED\r\nREDUCED LONG-STAY CYCLE PARKING REQUIREMENTS. IN ADDITION, THE APPLICATION\r\nSEEKS TO REGULARISE A MINOR VARIATION TO THE LOCATION OF THE ONSITE SUB-STATION\r\nIDENTIFIED THROUGH THE DETAILED DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION DRAWINGS PROCESS.",
